&lt;p&gt;This role reports to the Team Lead and partners closely with Brand, Growth, Web, Content, Product Marketing, and Developer Relations. You&#39;ll own projects from concept through execution, contribute to the evolution of our design systems, and help us scale creative output without sacrificing quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who cares deeply about craft, thrives in collaborative environments but is able to work autonomously while requiring minimal direction, and enjoys solving complex communication problems through thoughtful design.&lt;/p&gt;
