&lt;li&gt;Create reusable templates, design systems, and creative processes that improve consistency and efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Growth, Web, Product Marketing, Content, and Developer Relations to deliver cohesive customer experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present design concepts and rationale to stakeholders and thoughtfully incorporate feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance multiple projects while consistently delivering polished, production-ready work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute ideas that improve the quality, scalability, and effectiveness of our creative work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
