&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and continuously improve onboarding for new revenue hires, from pre-boarding through ramp milestones with the potential to lead in person sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extend onboarding into continuous everboarding enablement so reps keep building skills after initial ramp.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, launch, and manage recurring enablement programs (skill development, product launches, process rollouts, certifications).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable, role-specific enablement paths that support core competencies and career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the logistics, content, and cadence of programs end to end, keeping them on schedule and on quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with frontline managers and sales leadership to identify skill gaps and deliver targeted programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Instrument programs with metrics (ramp time, completion, competency) and iterate based on data and rep feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
