&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to design, launch, and scale enablement programs in fast-paced, high-growth environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills and meticulous attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written communication and facilitation/instructional-design instincts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management across multiple functions and seniority levels.&lt;/li&gt;
