&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Engineering, Security, Sales, Finance, People, Operations, Marketing, and other teams on company priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise across a range of matters that may include corporate governance, product development, open-source software, intellectual property, privacy, data, AI, security, employment, commercial relationships, compliance, and international operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable legal processes, policies, systems, and decision-making frameworks without creating unnecessary complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Determine which legal capabilities should be developed internally, delegated to future team members, or supported by outside counsel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire and empower legal team members, including building a dedicated commercial legal capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Select and manage outside counsel across the countries where Tailscale operates, balancing expertise, responsiveness, cost, and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate guidance across jurisdictions and translate local requirements into practical, consistent company practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support strategic partnerships, corporate initiatives, and other business-critical matters as Tailscale continues to grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate emerging legal and regulatory developments and help the company prepare for what comes next.&lt;/li&gt;
